/P 153 0 R
/E (Customer engagement plays a crucial role in influencing purchasing behavior, yet it remains unclear which specific engagement actions truly drive customers to complete a purchase. This study aims to identify the key differences between buyers and browsers and determine the most predictive customer actions that lead to purchase conversion.)
