<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (This project analyzed customer engagement and purchasing behavior using statistical and predictive modeling. Key engagement factors such as cart additions, time spent, pages visited, and prior purchases significantly influence purchase probability.  Overall, the findings show how data-driven approaches can transform e-commerce activity into actionable strategies for improving conversions, targeting customers, and guiding business decisions.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
